        "习　题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "252",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "252. 证明：两个球体的体积的比等于半径（直径）的立方",
        "比."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "253",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "253. 1) 地球的体积是月球体积的多少倍（地球的直径",
        "通常取1万3千公里，月球的直径取3.5千公里）？",
        "2) 为了使球的体积增大两倍，球面的直径必须增大多少",
        "倍？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "254",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "254. 球体的体积可以用近似公式 $V=\\frac{1}{2}d^3$ 计算. 得到",
        "的结果是不足的还是过剩的？求按照这个公式计算的相对",
        "误差."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "255",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "255. 铁球重量是400kg. 它的直径是多少？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "256",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "256. 直径2m的软木球的重量是多少？（软木的比重为",
        "$0.25\\mathrm{g}/\\mathrm{cm}^3$.）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "257",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "257. 在空间坐标系内，由不等式 $x^2+y^2+z^2\\leqslant R^2$ 给出的",
        "一个图形，求它的体积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "258",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "258. 球面 $x^2+y^2+z^2=R^2$ 围成的球，在位似中心为点",
        "$O$、位似比为 $k$ 的位似下，映射后的象为一个球. 求这个球的",
        "体积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "259",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "259. 正方体所有的顶点都在球面上. 如果正方体的棱长",
        "等于 $a$，求由这个球面围成的球体的体积."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "§69. 球面的面积"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "圆柱和圆锥的表面积是由它们的展开图的面积定义的.",
        "球面不能用那种方法，因为球面不能在平面上“展开”."
      ]
    },
    {
